{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id297564184"}, "name":{"label":"Jonofthejungle"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-18T01:00:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.20.0"}, "id":{"label":"12669089336"}, "title":{"label":"Lovely idea and the widgets are a great touch."}, "content":{"label":"I feel like we have found out a lot about each other through this app and it’s great for sparking conversation about subjects wouldn’t normally talk about this early on. \nI think it would be great to have a question reset button (it might already have one) to see how much we were listening to each other. \n\nSome of the question subjects are a bit repetitive and I have avoided a few sets of Lego questions after finding out we both liked it as children but never carried it into adulthood. \n\nI would like to see more “write your own answer” questions to really explore specifics.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
